---
// Jacob, solo (§0.1 default). The two-facilitator toggle (shared portrait +
// two bio cards, "I" → "we") is documented in the brief §14 for later.
---

<section class="we-about">
  <div class="we-about-inner">
    <div class="we-about-head">
      <div class="we-eyebrow" style="justify-content: center;">Who holds the workshop</div>
      <h2 class="we-h2 we-about-h2">
        Jacob Vermeulen — <em>your companion through the sound.</em>
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="we-about-portrait-wrap">
      <img
        class="we-about-portrait"
        src="/media/library/jacob-soft-portrait.webp"
        alt="Jacob Vermeulen"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </div>

    <p class="we-about-lead">
      I help people find their way back to themselves — through their own voice.
    </p>
    <p class="we-about-lead we-about-lead--body">
      I'm a pianist and singer, and the creator of Somatic Vocal Healing.
      Fifteen-plus years and a few thousand students later, it's become a way
      of working that's somatic, trauma-informed, and — I hope — honest. In
      this hour I'll hold a steady, careful space where your own sound can do
      the work. You don't have to perform. You just have to show up and make a
      sound.
    </p>

    <div class="we-about-cta-wrap">
      <a href="#register" class="we-link-cta">
        Register for the next workshop <i class="ph-light ph-arrow-right"></i>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
